      "title_at_amendment": "Engine installation ice protection.",
      "text": "[Propellers (except wooden propellers) and other components of complete engine installations must be protected against the accumulation of ice as necessary to enable satisfactory functioning without appreciable loss of power when operated in the icing conditions for which certification is requested.]",
